. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Respondents with 1 or more daughters will be more likely than respo
> ndents without daughters to express attitudinal support for gender equality. 
.         * We run a model with I as our dependent variable and d_daughter as o
> ur independent variable.
.         * As specified in the PAP, all models control for the number of child
> ren, the gender of the respondent and the year of birth.
.         * We also specified a one-sided test  for the coefficient on d_daught
> er in the PAP.
.         
.         
.         * run the regression
.         reg I d_daughter i.sex gebjahr i.numkids, robust

